{"id":"73f2379ff990998a","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-forcing-order.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Order","display":"df-zfc-forcing-order — ZFC Forcing Order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-order","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-order"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-order — ZFC Forcing Order","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-order — ZFC Forcing Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V,\\ \\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\times\\mathbb P\">\\(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V,\\ \\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\times\\mathbb P\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ForcingOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ForcingOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\mathrm{ForcingOrder}_S(\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\mathrm{ForcingOrder}_S(\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The forcing convention is that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q\">\\(p\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q\\)</span> means that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> is stronger than <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span>; the relation must still be reflexive, antisymmetric, and transitive.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V,\\ \\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\times\\mathbb P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ForcingOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\mathrm{ForcingOrder}_S(\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})","display":true},{"tex":"p\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false}],"bytes":929,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1972","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-forcing-order.md|58-df-zfc-forcing-order]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d3f859dbdd37f018"]}